<title>SWITZERLAND: CYCLING-TOUR OF ROMANDIE FIRST STAGE PLACINGS.</title>
<headline>CYCLING-TOUR OF ROMANDIE FIRST STAGE PLACINGS.</headline>
<dateline>LE LOCLE, Switzerland 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading placings in</p>
<p>the 167.8-km first stage of Tour of Romandie cycle race on</p>
<p>Wednesday:</p>
<p>1. Giuseppe Di Grande (Italy) 4 hours 54 minutes 12 seconds</p>
<p>2. Giuseppe Guerini (Italy)		 same time</p>
<p>3. Michael Boogerd (Netherlands)	  6 seconds behind</p>
<p>4. Pavel Tonkov (Russia)		    8 seconds</p>
<p>5. Michele Coppolillo (Italy)</p>
<p>6. Beat Zberg (Switzerland)</p>
<p>7. Roberto Petito (Italy)</p>
<p>8. Davide Rebellin (Italy)</p>
<p>9. Marco Pantani (Italy)</p>
<p>10. Alexandre Moos (Switzerland)</p>
<p>11. Paolo Savoldelli (Italy)</p>
